              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಎಚ್ಚೆತ್ತುಕೊಂಡೆ, eccettukoṇḍe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built with -ಕೊ, for oneself."
