          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬಲವಂತ (balavanta) is borrowed from Sanskrit balavant, \"strong\" (CDIAL 9166), from bala, \"strength\"; Kannada uses it for force put on someone."
            }
          ]
